  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help1,700 survivors of  flooding in Kinshasa-DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In December 2022 flooding hit some parts of Kinshasa the DRC Capital City and  affected more vulnerable people who lost everything they had in order to survive. The flooding caused deaths of people and destroyed houses and business which the lives of many depended, the survivors are now living in camps without assistance. This project will focusing of solving their key problems which is about shelter, livelihood activities and social opportunities such as education and health services.</narrative>
  </description>
